{
  "book": "jacob",
  "bookName": "Jacob",
  "chapter": 3,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 233.406,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 4.272,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But behold, I, Jacob, would speak unto you that are pure in heart.",
      "verse": "3:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 4.452,
      "end": 6.867,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Look unto God with firmness of mind,",
      "verse": "3:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 7.047,
      "end": 9.694,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and pray unto him with exceeding faith,",
      "verse": "3:1",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 9.874,
      "end": 12.289,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he will console you in your afflictions,",
      "verse": "3:1",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 12.469,
      "end": 14.234,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he will plead your cause,",
      "verse": "3:1",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 14.414,
      "end": 17.804,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and send down justice upon those who seek your destruction.",
      "verse": "3:1",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 18.484,
      "end": 20.62,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "O all ye that are pure in heart,",
      "verse": "3:2",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 20.8,
      "end": 24.237,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "lift up your heads and receive the pleasing word of God,",
      "verse": "3:2",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 24.417,
      "end": 26.182,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and feast upon his love;",
      "verse": "3:2",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 26.362,
      "end": 29.241,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for ye may, if your minds are firm, forever.",
      "verse": "3:2",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 29.921,
      "end": 33.032,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But, wo, wo, unto you that are not pure in heart,",
      "verse": "3:3",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 33.212,
      "end": 35.72,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that are filthy this day before God;",
      "verse": "3:3",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 35.9,
      "end": 39.29,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for except ye repent the land is cursed for your sakes;",
      "verse": "3:3",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 39.47,
      "end": 43.185,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the Lamanites, which are not filthy like unto you,",
      "verse": "3:3",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 43.365,
      "end": 46.662,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "nevertheless they are cursed with a sore cursing,",
      "verse": "3:3",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 46.842,
      "end": 49.35,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "shall scourge you even unto destruction.",
      "verse": "3:3",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 50.03,
      "end": 53.792,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the time speedily cometh, that except ye repent",
      "verse": "3:4",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 53.972,
      "end": 56.666,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they shall possess the land of your inheritance,",
      "verse": "3:4",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 56.846,
      "end": 60.422,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the Lord God will lead away the righteous out from among you.",
      "verse": "3:4",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 61.102,
      "end": 68.486,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, the Lamanites your brethren, whom ye hate because of their filthiness and the cursing which hath come upon their skins,",
      "verse": "3:5",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 68.666,
      "end": 70.663,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "are more righteous than you;",
      "verse": "3:5",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 70.843,
      "end": 74.001,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for they have not forgotten the commandment of the Lord,",
      "verse": "3:5",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 74.181,
      "end": 76.364,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which was given unto our father\u2014",
      "verse": "3:5",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 76.544,
      "end": 79.423,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they should have save it were one wife,",
      "verse": "3:5",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 79.603,
      "end": 81.971,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and concubines they should have none,",
      "verse": "3:5",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 82.151,
      "end": 85.309,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and there should not be whoredoms committed among them.",
      "verse": "3:5",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 85.989,
      "end": 88.729,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, this commandment they observe to keep;",
      "verse": "3:6",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 88.909,
      "end": 93.181,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore, because of this observance, in keeping this commandment,",
      "verse": "3:6",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 93.361,
      "end": 95.497,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the Lord God will not destroy them,",
      "verse": "3:6",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 95.677,
      "end": 97.86,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but will be merciful unto them;",
      "verse": "3:6",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 98.04,
      "end": 100.548,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and one day they shall become a blessed people.",
      "verse": "3:6",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 101.228,
      "end": 103.411,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, their husbands love their wives,",
      "verse": "3:7",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 103.591,
      "end": 106.006,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and their wives love their husbands;",
      "verse": "3:7",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 106.186,
      "end": 109.251,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and their husbands and their wives love their children;",
      "verse": "3:7",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 109.431,
      "end": 112.635,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and their unbelief and their hatred towards you",
      "verse": "3:7",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 112.815,
      "end": 116.019,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "is because of the iniquity of their fathers;",
      "verse": "3:7",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 116.199,
      "end": 120.75,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore, how much better are you than they, in the sight of your great Creator?",
      "verse": "3:7",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 121.43,
      "end": 122.684,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "O my brethren,",
      "verse": "3:8",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 122.864,
      "end": 125.883,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I fear that unless ye shall repent of your sins",
      "verse": "3:8",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 126.063,
      "end": 128.803,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that their skins will be whiter than yours,",
      "verse": "3:8",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 128.983,
      "end": 132.559,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "when ye shall be brought with them before the throne of God.",
      "verse": "3:8",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 133.239,
      "end": 137.744,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, a commandment I give unto you, which is the word of God,",
      "verse": "3:9",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 137.924,
      "end": 142.336,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that ye revile no more against them because of the darkness of their skins;",
      "verse": "3:9",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 142.516,
      "end": 146.51,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "neither shall ye revile against them because of their filthiness;",
      "verse": "3:9",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 146.69,
      "end": 149.198,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but ye shall remember your own filthiness,",
      "verse": "3:9",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 149.378,
      "end": 152.954,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and remember that their filthiness came because of their fathers.",
      "verse": "3:9",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 153.634,
      "end": 156.467,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, ye shall remember your children,",
      "verse": "3:10",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 156.647,
      "end": 162.034,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "how that ye have grieved their hearts because of the example that ye have set before them;",
      "verse": "3:10",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 162.214,
      "end": 165.697,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also, remember that ye may, because of your filthiness,",
      "verse": "3:10",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 165.877,
      "end": 168.245,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "bring your children unto destruction,",
      "verse": "3:10",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 168.425,
      "end": 172.047,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and their sins be heaped upon your heads at the last day.",
      "verse": "3:10",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 172.727,
      "end": 175.328,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "O my brethren, hearken unto my words;",
      "verse": "3:11",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 175.508,
      "end": 178.062,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "arouse the faculties of your souls;",
      "verse": "3:11",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 178.242,
      "end": 182.329,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "shake yourselves that ye may awake from the slumber of death;",
      "verse": "3:11",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 182.509,
      "end": 185.481,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and loose yourselves from the pains of hell",
      "verse": "3:11",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 185.661,
      "end": 188.447,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that ye may not become angels to the devil,",
      "verse": "3:11",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 188.627,
      "end": 193.085,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to be cast into that lake of fire and brimstone which is the second death.",
      "verse": "3:11",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 193.765,
      "end": 197.898,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now I, Jacob, spake many more things unto the people of Nephi,",
      "verse": "3:12",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 198.078,
      "end": 201.468,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "warning them against fornication and lasciviousness,",
      "verse": "3:12",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 201.648,
      "end": 203.32,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and every kind of sin,",
      "verse": "3:12",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 203.5,
      "end": 206.194,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "telling them the awful consequences of them.",
      "verse": "3:12",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 206.874,
      "end": 210.032,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And a hundredth part of the proceedings of this people,",
      "verse": "3:13",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 210.212,
      "end": 212.348,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which now began to be numerous,",
      "verse": "3:13",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 212.528,
      "end": 214.896,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "cannot be written upon these plates;",
      "verse": "3:13",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 215.076,
      "end": 219.163,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but many of their proceedings are written upon the larger plates,",
      "verse": "3:13",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 219.343,
      "end": 224.266,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and their wars, and their contentions, and the reigns of their kings.",
      "verse": "3:13",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 224.946,
      "end": 227.593,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "These plates are called the plates of Jacob,",
      "verse": "3:14",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 227.773,
      "end": 230.141,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they were made by the hand of Nephi.",
      "verse": "3:14",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 230.321,
      "end": 232.736,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I make an end of speaking these words.",
      "verse": "3:14",
      "lineIndex": 70
    }
  ]
}